    "body": "**[Alex Savitsky](https://jira.spring.io/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=asavitsky)** opened **[SPR-2894](https://jira.spring.io/browse/SPR-2894?redirect=false)** and commented\n\nWhen a DML operation fails a constraint (in my case, it was a UNIQUE constraint), the exception that gets thrown is swallowed by the Spring layer, without being passed to the client (it gets reported as an error condition in the logs though)\n\n\n---\n\n**Affects:** 2.0.1\n\n**Attachments:**\n- [Test.zip](https://jira.spring.io/secure/attachment/12250/Test.zip) (_6.41 kB_)\n",
